abstract: >
Proof RIX Phase I establishes a reproducible recursive transport-topology
framework for biological organization. The package reproduces canonical
Milestones 7–10 figures and metrics, including recursive capacity efficiency,
fragmentation boundaries, comparative transport regimes, predictive topology,
causal intervention analysis, and recursive transport phase mapping.
